  "path_decision": [
    "Default visitors are held in spectator mode without operator privileges; vanilla/PvP positive and negative pairs cover that invariant.",
    "GuardInventoryMixin cancels container click and button packets before handlers, including already-open menus; persisted Backpack transfers tested in both adapters.",
    "GuardPayloadMixin cancels non-brand play-phase custom payloads for visitors before mod handlers. Configuration-phase negotiation remains unaffected.",
    "Create wrench, owned camera opening, aircraft mounting and Carry On controls cover the additional interaction families in this fixed inventory.",
    "Both manager-refused missing/corrupt Guard starts have actual native-client refusal, exact original restoration and rejoin evidence.",
    "Results apply only to the listed artifacts, configurations and interaction cases; no broader mod or menu coverage is claimed."
  ],
  "excluded": [
    "Other Minecraft/modloader combinations",
    "New or changed mod files",
    "Arbitrarily modified visitor grants or operator rights",
    "Malicious NAS operator or filesystem replacement",
    "A guarantee that third-party mods have no independent vulnerabilities"
  ],
